   "text": "The Deck Builder's Toolkit ( Kaladesh Edition) is a box set that was released on September 30, 2016. It contains 100 basic land cards (20 of each type from Kaladesh ), 85 fixed cards, 40 of 125 semi- randomized cards suitable for building several different Magic decks, and four 15-card booster packs , two from Shadows over Innistrad block and two from Kaladesh . You also get a deck builder's guide with tips about building the best Magic decks, a Magic \"learn to play\" guide and a full-art reusable card storage box. All the fixed and semi-random cards in the box are from Shadows over Innistrad , Eldritch Moon , Kaladesh and Welcome Deck 2016 .",
   "scene": 0,
   "section": ""
  },
